# Plan 22's hand-flown battle: flight (combat-parity.sh at Lieutenant, so Worf stays off).
# Every flight key, alone and together, all stop, the orbit, and the views, zoom and wide view.
at 0 steer 0 0 0 1
at 40 steer 1 0 0 1
at 80 steer 1 1 0 0
at 120 steer 0 -1 1 0
at 160 steer -1 0 -1 -1
at 200 steer 0 0 0 0
at 220 stop
at 260 steer 0 1 0 1
at 300 orbit 1
at 340 orbit -1
at 360 orbit 0
at 380 view 5 enterprise
at 400 zoom in
at 420 wide on
at 480 wide off
at 500 cycle
at 520 view 12 target
at 540 zoom out
at 560 steer 1 -1 1 1
at 640 steer 0 0 0 0
